hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1158","Abu Hurayra described the Messenger of Allah"
"1159","Aslam said"
"1160","Mujahid said"
"1161","Malik ibn Zubayd said"
"1162","Ibn 'Abbas reported that the Prophet"
"1163","Al-'Iryan ibn al-Haytham said"
"1164","Abu al-Aaliyah said that he sat on the chair of state with Ibn Abbas (ra). \n\nIn another version"
"1165","Abu Khulda reported that he heard Anas ibn Malik when he was with\nal-Hakam"
"1166","Anas ibn Malik said"
"1167","Abu Rifa'a al-'Adawi said"
"1168","Musa ibn Dihqan said"
"1169","Sa'id al-Maqburi said"
"1170","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1171","'Abdullah reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1172","'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
"1173","Ibn 'Umar reported something similar from the Prophet"
"1174","'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
"1175","Ibn 'Umar said"
"1176","Abu Burda ibn Abi Musa said"
"1177","Qays related that his father arrived while the Messenger of Allah"
"1178","Abu Sa'id al-Khudri said"
"1179","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported his fasting was mentioned to the Messenger\nof Allah"
